# Neon Database — {{PROJECT_BASENAME}}

Use `neonctl` (install with `npm install -g neonctl`, authenticate with
`neonctl auth`). Pass `--project-id` and the intended branch explicitly;
for SQL, also pass `--database-name`. Use `--output json` for metadata reads.

